    <p class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE PIECES</p>
    <h1>Collecting is personal.<br><em>So is JKR Vault.</em></h1>
    <p>We buy, sell, and trade sports cards, memorabilia, and collectibles to connect enthusiasts with the items they love. Sports cards are at the heart of JKR Vault, with room for the signatures, stories, and unexpected finds that make a collection your own.</p>
    <p>Whether you’re chasing a longtime favorite or making your first find, you’re welcome here.</p>
    <h2>A clear path to your next find.</h2>
    <p>Our website introduces the collection. Our eBay profile shows the items currently offered for purchase, with actual item photographs, condition details, prices, shipping, and returns on each listing. Purchases from our eBay listings are completed on eBay.</p>
    <p>Our public SportsCardsPro collection offers a wider view of our collecting interests and may include personal pieces that are not for sale.</p>
